Translation scope
-----------------
The maintained Fortran source is a clean translation/reimplementation of the
computational algorithms in the upstream R and C sources. It does not include
R formula parsing, S3 methods, graphics, interactive facilities, R's Matrix
objects, compiled R registration code, or copies of dependency packages.

Principal upstream files consulted include:
  src/links.c, src/get_fitted.c, src/utilityFuns.c
  R/gdist.R, R/gumbel.R, R/lgamma.R, R/AO.R
  R/utils.R, R/clm.R, R/clm.start.R, R/clm.fitter.R, R/clm.fit.R, R/clm.simple.R
  R/clm.profile.R, R/drop.coef.R, R/clmm.R, R/clmm.ssr.R, R/clmm.ranef.R
  R/derivatives.R

